<title>NORWAY: Aker in NOK 150 mln deal with BP.</title>
<headline>Aker in NOK 150 mln deal with BP.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian offshore services company Aker Maritime ASA said on Thursday it had won a 150 million crown contract from British Petroleum.</p>
<p>The contract is for the upgrading of the drilling rig Shelf-5 in the Caspian Sea.</p>
</text>
